* ''A resend that meets its act still waiting refunds the attempt'' (controller ruling, 2026-11-12, overrulable; built, `50b8fd8ae`). The page's retry bound counts only sends the vessel never acknowledged (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/dreamdom-port-contract#/retry-law`>>).

